        "en": "Given the heavy demand for charitable veterinary services, pet owners frequently experience waits of several hours past their scheduled appointment times. While some urgent cases receive immediate attention, clients note that walk-in emergencies face long waits in busy communal waiting rooms where unmuzzled or anxious animals sit close together."
      }
    }
